\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Cell capacity vs.\ Tropical Realization Complexity. The $\gamma $-code packing bound permits $\sim $$10^{59}$ confident decodes but only $\sim $48 are realized---capacity is not the binding limit. TRC is: a \textsc  {[proved]}\ rank budget ($\le \min (M,d)$) plus a \textsc  {[measured]}\ interference term that is a Welch packing of routing features into $\mathbb  {R}^{M}$ (rule-activation space), set in practice by per-example routing.}}{3}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
